  "details": "Cameras are allowed on avatars, but the ability to set a replacement shader is not exposed to avatars.\n\nAllowing this feature on avatars will allow for more complex camera-based effects, including post processing Render footage into all sorts of debug effects (Wireframe, Overdraw, Mip Maps, Lightmap checks)\n\nFurthermore, if this idea were to be extended to the Main Reference camera, then users could use these debug effects on their whole view, rather than on a handheld render\n\nUnity doc for RenderWithShader\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/6000.0/Documentation/ScriptReference/Camera.RenderWithShader.html",
